Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.92,0:00:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like Nadeshiko is\Ncontinuing to wear me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.17,0:00:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But getting into a romantic\Nrelationship with a romance-bot is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But hey,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}having someone to welcome\Nme home is pretty nice.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.85,0:00:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Akane!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I withdraw my statement!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.11,0:00:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.67,0:00:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.24,0:00:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Or would you like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's gone past girlfriend\Ninto newlywed wife!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.49,0:00:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, enough of that stuff already.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.12,0:00:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all this super-fancy food?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- You have cooking functions, too?!\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.59,0:00:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My base programming\Nis only for communication,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.05,0:00:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can combine that with newly\Nlearned information to take on other tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but that's still...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.89,0:01:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\a6}BATH TEMPERATURE{Not there in OV Subs}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.39,0:01:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So, which comes first?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.15,0:01:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You can eat me, too, if you—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.15,0:01:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm eating dinner, taking\Na bath and going to bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.82,0:01:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't taken a warm bath in months.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nadeshiko demonstrated that she\Ncan act outside of her programming.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.79,0:01:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That she can learn just like a human.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.29,0:01:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane? Is the water\Ntemperature to your liking?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.75,0:01:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember what I asked, right?\NAfter your bath, it's time for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's quite all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's... It's all slick now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the Iubricating compounds\Nallow for easily enhanced pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(225,0)\fsp3\an8\fnGlenns Hand\c&H18164B&\fs60\bord2\frz348.1\pos(1568,636)}Was the bath\Nalways this slimy?{Not there in OV subs}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(225,0)\fsp3\an9\fnGlenns Hand\c&H18164B&\fs50\bord2\frz36.72\pos(638,320)}Oh well... It's fine.{Not there in OV subs}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.56,0:01:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had no idea I was so\Nbadly in need of a bath.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.31,0:01:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnGlenns Hand\fsp3\c&H18164B&\fs50\bord2\pos(278,842)}Akane's thoughts\Nin the bath{Not there in OV subs}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Seriously, hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.28,0:01:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying immersed in there\NWill get you all hot and bothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:02:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There are other ways to\Nenjoy a bath, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.87,0:02:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,For instance, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hey, so that's your angle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.75,0:02:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Angle? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Soaking in this slick and\Nslippery lube bath feels really good.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.88,0:02:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it's kinda weird...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can feel the arousal\Nwelling up deep inside me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.59,0:02:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so nice to see you so\Nmuch more turned on than usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.75,0:02:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\bord0\blur2\fs170\xshad-6\yshad-4\fnHorror Monster\4c&H000000&\4a&H4F&\pos(732,516)}APHRODISIAC{Not there in OV subs}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.22,0:02:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because of the\Nsoft-shelled turtle you ate at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is delicious!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is {\i1}that{\i0} how badly you\Nwant to have sex with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed. Because I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,love you so very much, Akane!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She loves me? But that's got to just be\Nher programming, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about you, Akane?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you love me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.46,0:02:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:02:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.63,0:03:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't really think straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.68,0:03:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.72,0:03:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!\NMy hands had completely stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,440)\fs35\bord2.5\blur0.5\b0\shad0\3c&HD0377A&\c&HF7FFFC&\fnA-OTF Shin Go Pro R\pos(370,202)}Brought to you by ToonsHub
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.65,0:03:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And what's worse is how she got me to\Nmake those sounds over and over again...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.45,0:03:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, an email.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.91,0:03:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(0,0)\p1\c&HF7F9F9&}m 496 354 l 1408 354 1408 804 496 804
